## Live testing: walking a copy of the session as your character

wf-mapping-test-map-name = Test of {$name}
wf-mapping-test-range-name = Test range

wf-mapping-test-started = Testing {$name}. Back to mapping takes you back where you were.
wf-mapping-test-returned = Back to mapping {$name}.
wf-mapping-test-time-up = The test of {$name} ran out of time.
wf-mapping-test-ended-by-owner = The owner ended the test of {$name}.
wf-mapping-test-already = You are already testing.
wf-mapping-test-no-edit = Nothing can be edited while testing. Go back to mapping first.
wf-mapping-test-cooldown = The last test just ended; try again in {$seconds} seconds.
wf-mapping-test-global-cooldown = Another test just started on the server; try again in {$seconds} seconds.
wf-mapping-test-max-running = The server already runs {$max} tests, its limit. Try again when one ends.
wf-mapping-test-too-big = The session has {$count} entities; a test copies it, so it needs {$max} or fewer (entity limit {$limit}).
wf-mapping-test-failed = The test couldn't be started.
wf-mapping-test-end-not-owner = Only the owner ends the test for everyone.
wf-mapping-test-no-ftl = No FTL in a test: fly the ship with its thrusters.

